Codex is not signed in.
  Sign in (opens a browser):
      CODEX_HOME=/srv/codex-home '/opt/codex tools/bin/codex' login
  On a machine without a browser, such as over SSH:
      CODEX_HOME=/srv/codex-home '/opt/codex tools/bin/codex' login --device-auth
  Device-code login must first be enabled in your ChatGPT security settings (or by your workspace admin); if it isn't available, sign in on a machine with a browser.
  Or run `recite auth login`, which runs the same command for you.
More help: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/auth
